/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 10:11:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50193416</guid></item><item><title>比 Earcut 更快：在 489 毫秒内对 370 万个地图多边形进行三角测量</title><link>https://globus.software/blog/2026/10/16/cutting-map-polygons/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;文章网址： &lt;a href="https://globus.software/blog/2026/10/16/cutting-map-polygons/"&gt;https://globus.software/blog/2026/10/16/cutting-map-polygons/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;评论网址： &lt;a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50193170"&gt;https://news.ycombinator.com/item?&lt;/a&gt; id=50193170&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;积分：222&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; # 评论: 40&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:31:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://globus.software/blog/2026/10/16/cutting-map-polygons/</guid></item><item><title>CVE-2026-111943：中间证书颁发机构受损</title><link>https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/cve-2026-111943</link><description>&lt;p&gt;文章网址： &lt;a href="https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/cve-2026-111943"&gt;https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/cve-2026-111943&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;评论网址： &lt;a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50192900"&gt;https://news.ycombinator.com/item?&lt;/a&gt; id=50192900&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;积分：335&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; # 评论: 122&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 08:51:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/cve-2026-111943</guid></item><item><title>越狱 Switch 2</title><link>https://pepsipu.com/blog/2026-10-switch2-jailbreak-ns2jb/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;文章网址： &lt;a href="https://pepsipu.com/blog/2026-10-switch2-jailbreak-ns2jb/"&gt;https://pepsipu.com/blog/2026-10-switch2-jailbreak-ns2jb/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;评论网址： &lt;a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50192536"&gt;https://news.ycombinator.com/item?&lt;/a&gt; id=50192536&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;积分：794&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; # 评论：287&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 08:01:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://pepsipu.com/blog/2026-10-switch2-jailbreak-ns2jb/</guid></item></channel></rss>